      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1770912136058,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "High frquency of writes and query effiency\n10 M driver location updates every 5 seconds, which means 2M request per seconds\n-> search driver within the range\n",
